    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Choose explicit natural-system complexity tasks and compare predictive or explanatory performance of models that use computational universality with matched models that do not. Consistent, substantial gains would support usefulness for those tasks, not universal cruciality.";
